    "caption": "ADHD mom confession: 4 planners this year, same task on page 1 of every one 🫠\n\nplanners tell me what to do. they never helped me start. what finally did: making step 1 as small as washing a dish.\n\nhow many planners are you on? 👇\nsave this for the next drop-off 📌\n\nthe app on the last slides is FOCO, link in bio 💜",
