  "instagram": {
    "caption": "ADHD planner confession: 4 planners this year, and the same task sits on page 1 of every one.\n\nI'm not lazy. I can wash a dish because a dish is small. \"Write the newsletter\" isn't, and no planner ever changed that.\n\n1. 9:10, daycare drop-off, 3 hours for one job\n2. I went to wash one dish and cleaned the whole kitchen\n3. 11:20, my client emails, pickup is at 12:30\n4. I said the task out loud and did only step 1: open last month's newsletter\n\n12:14, first draft done.\n\nSave this, and send it to the mom friend with a planner collection.\n\n💜 The app I use is FOCO, link in bio.",
